Package: poEvaluationMetrics
Title: Calculating Evaluation Metrics For Species Distribution Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lisa", "Bald", , "bald@staff.uni-marburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes evaluation metrics for species distribution models (SDMs)
    including AUC, correlation, precision-recall gain, Boyce-type indices (SBI),
    threshold-based scores (TSS, Kappa, F1-style scores), and omission rate.
    Supports presence–absence, presence–background (with generated background points),
    and presence–artificial-absence workflows using CAST Area of Applicability.
